msgid "**Parameters:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/rhea_tools.rst:36 5e42c28b249a481197e400cb3b1700ad
msgid ""
"``chebi_id`` (string) (required) ChEBI compound identifier. Can include "
"or omit 'CHEBI:' prefix. Examples: 'CHEBI:17234' (glucose), 'CHEBI:15377'"
" (water), 'CHEBI:15422' (ATP), 'CHEBI:16761' (ADP)."
msgstr ""

